   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develop a peer reviewed Gender Just Transition Framework and guidelines as a unifying definition and shared terminology for gender in just transitions, with particular focus on informality with the aim in a subsequent stage to field test within the work of leading international institutions for Green Transitions.     Proposed activities 1.    Peer review of papers from GEG outcomes of Gender Just Transitions and Finance workstreams 2.    Complete outcome level framework and facilitate road[IS1] -test 3.    Develop guidance for use of outcome level framework and apply to national cases.</narrative>
